<title>LIBERIA: Helicopter with Ukrainian crew missing in Liberia.</title>
<headline>Helicopter with Ukrainian crew missing in Liberia.</headline>
<dateline>MONROVIA 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A helicopter used by the European Union team monitoring Liberian elections has gone missing with three Ukrainian crew members, the EU mission said on Sunday.</p>
<p>EU spokesman Paul Harrington said the chartered MI8 helicopter disappeared about five days ago during a flight from the capital Monrovia to Voinjama in the remote northwest to deliver polling materials for Saturday's elections.</p>
<p>The crew members were the only people on board.</p>
<p>A 52-member EU observer team monitored Liberia's presidential and parliamentary elections.</p>
</text>
